qudt:minInclusive dcterms:description "minInclusive is the inclusive lower bound of the value space for a datatype with the ordered property. The value of minInclusive must be in the value space of the base type.";
                  a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt>,
