                             <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt>;
            rdfs:label "om unit".
qudt:onlineReference a owl:AnnotationProperty;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt>,
                                      <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt>;
                     rdfs:label "online reference";
                     rdfs:range xsd:anyURI.
