qudt:positiveDeltaLimit dcterms:description "A positive change limit between consecutive sample values for a parameter. The Positive Delta may be the encoded value or engineering units value depending on whether or not a Calibrator is defined."^^rdf:HTML;
                        a owl:DatatypeProperty;
